        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alvin Straight, Rose Straight, Richard Farnsworth, Sissy Spacek, Dick Van Dyke, Edward G. Robinson, Jerry Paris\n- Films: The Straight Story, Never a Dull Moment (1968 film)\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Topics: World War II veterans, intellectual disability, American comedy crime films\n\nFacts:\n- In The Straight Story, Alvin Straight is an elderly World War II veteran.\n- In The Straight Story, Alvin Straight lives with his daughter Rose Straight.\n- In The Straight Story, Rose Straight is a kind woman with an intellectual disability, and Sissy Spacek portrays her.\n- Richard Farnsworth portrays Alvin Straight in The Straight Story.\n- Never a Dull Moment is a 1968 American comedy crime film.\n- Never a Dull Moment was produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Dick Van Dyke and Edward G. Robinson star in Never a Dull Moment.\n- Jerry Paris directed Never a Dull Moment.",
